comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T18:29:07.548Z",codex-agent,"Seven focused tests passed. Independent mixed-radix oracle checks all 32 small constraint masks; mandatory cases, partial covers, exclusion witnesses, immutable model binding and contradictory reported outcomes are exercised. V1 follows the specification exhaustive deterministic greedy algorithm and strength one or two; higher strength is deferred in pm-case-later."
  "2026-11-06T19:11:12.212Z",codex-agent,"Implemented all seven commands and shared typed SDK kernels. The v1 specification deliberately uses bounded exhaustive enumeration and deterministic greedy selection with canonical ties and fixed seed zero. Strength above two and alternate IPOG strategies are deferred in pm-case-later. Independent brute-force and 24 seeded proposal/apply sequences pass; linked kernel run passes 11 tests. Stored plans also bind their latest selection receipt, and packet omissions count earlier pages separately from remaining continuation."
